 0921; certificate 0921-BPR-2046 and provided with the CE-marking"},{"citation":"EN 1542","section":"APPLICATION INSTRUCTIONS","page":2,"context":"In case of doubt, carry out adherence testing to determine which primer is most suitable - wait at least 2 weeks after application prior to conduct the adhesion test as per EN 1542"}]}}